      "text": "Auth/signup flow\n/auth/signup page -> /api/auth/signup\nvalidate JU/HU email + password\nSupabase auth.signUp\nDB RPC check_signup_rate_limit\n/auth/callback exchanges code\ncreates profiles row if missing",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
